## Model card

- **Name:** Glyph Cluster (anonymous stealth reasoning model; Vercel AI Gateway stealth listing)
- **Short description:** Anonymous stealth reasoning model in early access (maker not confirmed; attributed to Microsoft AI / MAI research telemetry), text-only reasoning for coding and long-context work; free during its stealth period via Vercel AI Gateway (Pro/Enterprise teams with purchased AI Gateway credits) and OpenRouter (`stealth/glyph-cluster`).
- **Provider / access:** Vercel AI Gateway / OpenRouter (`stealth/glyph-cluster`); free preview tier ($0/$0/$0); function calling present; no structured outputs; no image input; no zero data retention, so prompts and responses may be used for training.
- **Release / knowledge:** Stealth catalog listing spotted 2026-10-07 (Vercel AI Gateway); early access.
- **IDs:** `stealth/glyph-cluster`; attributed maker Microsoft AI / MAI.
- **Context window:** 256,000 total; max output 256,000 — per curated meta (`model/glyph-cluster/meta.json`) and tracker listings.
- **Modalities:** Text in; text out.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Free preview tier ($0/$0/$0 via Vercel AI Gateway & OpenRouter).

